I found the cause of the zone B problem. Wave template ZB_WAVE_01 sorts by st=
orage bin ID instead of by pick path sequence, so tasks jump between aisles B=
03 and B11. The fix is a small change to the template and takes about 2 hours=
 including a test in the quality system. I can do it today if we release the =
freeze for this one template.

